SUMMARY:Gardens of Markham Tour
DESCRIPTION:Explore the beauty of Markham and Unionville’s hidden gardens at the Markham Garden and Horticultural Society’s (MGHS) Garden Tour on Sunday June 28\, 2026. This tour features ten private gardens\, each offering inspiration and creative ideas for garden enthusiasts of all levels. Stroll through thoughtfully designed gardens\, meet fellow gardeners\, and enjoy the charm of these tucked-away gems.
