SUMMARY:Niagara-on-the-Lake Horticultural Society Annual Gardener's Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:The NOTL Annual Gardener’s Garden Tour will be held Saturday July 11th – 9:30am to 4:00pm \nWe have 8 beautiful gardens throughout NOTL and 2 points of interest – yours to enjoy for the day. Speak to the home gardeners and discover plants and gardening tips to bring back to your own home garden. \nProceeds contribute to 3 horticultural scholarships here in NOTL. \nEARLY BIRD TICKETS ARE ON SALE NOW – $10.00 OFF PER TICKET! \nSee more details of the Tour and a link to Eventbrite at notlhortsociety.com \nOr go directly to Eventbrite https://tinyurl.com/4na34zr9 \nWe hope to see you on July 11th.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/niagara-on-the-lake-horticultural-society-annual-gardeners-garden-tour/
LOCATION:Niagara-on-the-Lake\, Niagara-on-the-Lake\, L0S 1J0
CATEGORIES:Community Event,Garden Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/2026-GARDEN-TOUR-EVENT-INVITE.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Niagara on the Lake Horticultural Society":MAILTO:notlhortsociety@gmail.com
