SUMMARY:Rain Garden and Tree Care Presentation
DESCRIPTION:During this walk\, join Reep’s tree and plant experts to explore how trees and rain gardens can be integrated into your property.  Learn about local tree canopy and identification\, the benefits and challenges of growing trees in urban settings\, and practical approaches to tree care.
