UID:10001862-1785871800-1785879000@gardenontario.org
SUMMARY:August General Meeting: Guest Speaker Debbie Coleman
DESCRIPTION:August General Meeting: Guest Speaker Debbie Coleman\, “Garden Maintenance”\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTonight’s speaker will share practical tips and tricks to help keep our gardens looking their best all season long. We will explore how to handle common challenges like pests and disease\, how to properly prune flowers and vegetables\, how to choose the right fertilizer\, and even how to manually pollinate our plants when the bees need a little backup.   \nDebbie Coleman is a Master Gardener and Richmond Hill Garden & Horticultural Society Director who believes that the more time we spend up close with our plants the more likely we are to notice problems before they get out of hand. \nTonight’s guest speaker is a resident of Richmond Hill and will be participating in-person. \nMembers: Instructions for participation in this virtual and in-person event will be emailed to members twice – once on the Friday prior to the meeting\, and again on Monday. Instructions are also available by logging into our site and checking the “members-only” version of this event. \nVisitors: Guests are welcome to participate in this virtual and in-person event at a nominal fee of $5.00. Instructions for participation will be emailed to non-society members who complete the registration process prior to the event start time. Please visit the website at https://www.richmondhillgardensociety.org/event-6532543 \nAbout In-Person Attendance at the McConaghy Centre:  \n\nDoors to the auditorium open at 7:00 pm \nThe meeting begins promptly at 7:30 pm\nTo help us reduce waste and save money\, please bring a mug or cup if you would like hot coffee or tea\nClick here for more information about our General Meetings\, including directions to the McConaghy Centre
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/august-general-meeting-guest-speaker-debbie-coleman/
LOCATION:McConaghy Centre\, 10100 Yonge Street\, Richmond Hill\, L4C 1T8
CATEGORIES:Guest Speaker
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/Hort-logo-design-2015-2-2-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Richmond Hill Garden and Horticultural Society":MAILTO:RHInfo@GardenOntario.org
GEO:43.8737179;-79.4383234
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=McConaghy Centre 10100 Yonge Street Richmond Hill L4C 1T8;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=10100 Yonge Street:geo:-79.4383234,43.8737179
END:VEVENT
